864 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Join us for an insightful virtual event featuring leaders from Adobe and Concentrix as we explore how AI is revolutionizing commerce for B2B and B2C businesses\056\n\nDiscover how to deliver scalable\054 personalized experiences and unlock new growth opportunities\072\n\nLearn how autonomous AI agents and Adobe\047s platform enable seamless multi\055channel experiences across web\054 mobile\054 and marketplaces\024all managed from a single back end\nSee how leading brands are deploying AI agents for personalized shopping experiences\054 intelligent inventory management\054 and seamless omnichannel engagement\nGet actionable strategies for implementing AI\055powered commerce\240in your organization\054 from identifying high\055impact use cases to measuring ROI and scaling successfully\n\nEnjoy a chocolate tasting on us while gaining practical insights to accelerate your commerce transformation\056 Don\047t miss this opportunity to stay ahead in the rapidly evolving world of digital commerce\056\n\n)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 865 0 R
     /Pg 852 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
